&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is an Enterprise Account Executive at Talkdesk…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive at Talkdesk, you will be responsible for pipeline generation across: SDR, Channel Partners, Marketing and Self-generation, targeting entities with 1000+ employees that are aligned to your region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a driven, motivated and ambitious Enterprise Account Executives. Someone who will proactively acquire new prospects and drive forward our business offerings through solution based selling. Bring your passion for customer experience and join Talkdesk on our rocketship to success!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate a strong pipeline to ensure extensive coverage. Resulting in consistent quota achievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create excellent internal relationships; you cannot close those big deals on your own!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the complete and complex sales-cycles. Including pipeline generation and often presenting to C-level executives the value of Talkdesk’s solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline the contracts phase; Strong proposal, terms and negotiation experience is important&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with the Talkdesk sales Go-to-Market plan to develop and own accountability for your region’s targeted prospects. Including delivering accurate forecasting and planning to Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build partner, channel, and alliance relationships to to sell more successfully and overachieve your quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a Talkdesk Evangelist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in collaboration with internal resources to own and grow your new business pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a base of active customers to upsell new products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individuals who enjoy the challenge of Net New Logo’s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of being able to create self generated opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent success selling software into Large Corporate and Enterprise accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced closing 5-7 figure multi-year contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced selling to C-suite, senior management and director-level individuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion builders and trusted advisors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to command the attention in a room by delivering compelling presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive negotiation and contract development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, dynamic startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Talkdesk is pioneering a new era of Customer Experience Automation (CXA), redefining how the world’s most admired brands interact with their customers through AI. Our global team of courageous innovators is customer-obsessed, building AI-first solutions that put empathy, trust, and transparency at the center of every interaction. We foster an inclusive culture where diverse perspectives drive our success and every voice belongs. Combining the stability of a global leader with the agility of a disruptor, Talkdeskers are empowered with the autonomy to drive meaningful impact, while giving back to the communities and environment around us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Talkdesk has been recognized as a Leader in the Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for Contact Center as a Service (CCaaS) and in the G2 Overall Grid® Reports for AI Agents and Contact Center. With seven consecutive years on the Forbes Cloud 100 and multiple AI Breakthrough awards, there has never been a more exciting time to join us as we shape the future of customer experience automation!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment and Physical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Primarily office-environment work, extended periods of sitting or standing, computer-based work. Limited lifting, and equipment usage limited to computer-related equipment (keyboards, mouse, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Talkdesk story hinges on empathy and acceptance. It is the shared goal among all Talkdeskers to empower a new kind of customer hero through our innovative software solution, and we firmly believe that the best path to success for our mission is inclusivity, diversity, and genuine acceptance. To that end, we will hire, promote, work along, cheer for, bond with, and warmly welcome into the Talkdesk family all persons without regard to ethnic and racial identity, indigenous heritage, national origin, religion, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, disability, marital status, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nebius Managed Kubernetes (mk8s) mission is to grow the Nebius cloud platform by providing a Kubernetes-native way to run AI systems with high efficiency and low operational overhead.&amp;nbsp;With a single click, it provides a Kubernetes cluster on top of Nebius services for compute (VMs) and networking.&amp;nbsp;In 2026, the service is scaling 10× and is expected to manage customer workloads across tens of thousands of GPU servers in more than 10 data centers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the mk8s Core team, one of three mk8s teams. The Core team owns the API, the core of the service control plane, cluster autoscaling, platform integrations, and running k8s add-ons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Nebius, team leads are hands-on. We expect you to be a senior or staff engineer now (or earlier in your career). You will start as an individual contributor to gain context, then take on managerial responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you will be responsible to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead by example.&lt;/strong&gt; Set the quality bar by spending a significant portion of your time on IC work: writing and reviewing code, leading projects, and participating in on-call rotation, incident mitigation, and post-incident analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage 4–8 mid-to-senior engineers.&lt;/strong&gt; Provide context, coach, and give regular feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain the technical vision&lt;/strong&gt; for your area of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with the Product Manager and Service Owner&lt;/strong&gt; to shape product vision and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Examples of outcomes you could drive as a Team Lead&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize the service control plane to create and manage 20K GPU nodes in a single Kubernetes cluster, enabling a major contract for the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate cluster autoscaling approaches (e.g., Karpenter) to improve resource utilization and support seamless auto-upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a Kubernetes-native way to use local disks to reduce disk I/O bottlenecks for AI training and inference, improving efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver managed Layer 7 load balancers to reduce operational overhead for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring to the table:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering or management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of Golang, or you are ready to quickly switch to this programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-month technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech leading engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning multi-month technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be an added bonus if you had:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Team management, Kubernetes administration, Developing Kubernetes controller.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer to build the event-processing pipelines and services that turn Nebius product usage into revenue.&lt;br&gt;You will work on systems that process a continuous stream of usage events, where correctness and failure recovery matter as much as throughput. The output is money: a silently dropped or double-counted event is a real financial error.&lt;br&gt;Usage of every Nebius product arrives as a stream of events. Our pipelines and services ingest, validate, enrich and price it in near real time, and deliver the results to invoicing, reporting and customer-facing account management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build stateful streaming pipelines that compute billed consumption in near real time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and operate Go services that ingest usage events, move data between our storage systems and deliver consumption data to users through usage APIs and billing data exports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guarantee correctness under failures: idempotency, exactly-once processing and reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate transactional storage, persistent queues and change data capture under high throughput.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable streaming infrastructure rather than solving each use case independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, scalability, latency and observability of the billing platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end ownership of your systems: design, implementation, reliability and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience building and operating backend, streaming or data-intensive systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to reason about consistency and data correctness under failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with databases, messaging systems or event-processing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to investigate unfamiliar systems and solve problems without an obvious predefined solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability and willingness to learn the team&#39;s technology stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a stateful stream-processing framework such as Apache Flink or Kafka Streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing streaming pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating services in Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Technology stack&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go, Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apache Flink&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;YDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;YTsaurus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Messaging and event-streaming systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Nebius is building the cloud infrastructure that will power the next generation of Physical AI—robotics, autonomous systems, simulation, and embodied intelligence operating in the real world. As a European-headquartered AI infrastructure company, EMEA is a strategic home market for Nebius and one of the most consequential regions in the global Physical AI buildout—from UK autonomy and foundation-model players, to German humanoid and industrial robotics, to Swiss legged-robotics and Israeli/Nordic frontier startups, to the EU&#39;s rapidly accelerating defence and dual-use AI ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The Principal, EMEA GTM – Physical AI owns our GTM motion across EMEA: a regional sales overlay role built to drive repeatable revenue within our first and most important segment—Physical AI natives based in or operating across Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. This is not a generalist regional AE seat. It is a domain-led, EMEA-anchored pipeline generator and deal accelerator designed to create leverage: tighter narratives, sharper use-case framing, and category assets that the EMEA field can run independently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;You will open strategic, executive-level accounts across the EMEA Physical AI ecosystem, generate qualified pipeline, and personally lead engagement across our EMEA Top 25 target list. On top-tier deals, you will partner directly with EMEA Account Executives, regional sales leadership, and the Physical AI Field CTO team to shape the opportunity early, act as executive sponsor, and accelerate time-to-close. In parallel, you will turn what you learn in-region into repeatable motions—subsegment theses, playbooks, and enablement—tailored to the EMEA buyer, the regulatory environment (EU AI Act, GDPR, data sovereignty), and the region&#39;s multi-country go-to-market complexity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;This is a definitive “zero-to-one” opportunity to build the EMEA commercial foundation for a new cloud category from the ground up, in a region where Nebius has structural home-market advantage. You are welcome to work remotely from within EMEA, with strong preference for London or Munich; Paris or Amsterdam are also viable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA Pipeline Generation &amp;amp; Account Ownership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Generate qualified, industry-sourced pipeline and open strategic, executive-level accounts within the EMEA Physical AI ecosystem—autonomous vehicles, humanoid and industrial robotics, foundation-model and world-model builders, industrial computer vision, and the OEM/Tier-1 cohort investing in Physical AI in Germany, France, Sweden, and Italy. Personally own engagement for our EMEA Top 25 target list and ensure each account has a clear engagement plan and is actively progressing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Acceleration with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA Field:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Frame use cases and shape solution direction in the early stages of a deal. Partner directly with EMEA AEs, regional GMs, and the Field CTO on top-tier accounts to accelerate closure, acting as the executive sponsor and regional domain authority. Your involvement is the difference between a stalled deal and a closed one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA Lighthouse Account Execution:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Identify and secure the most innovative companies across EMEA&#39;s AI-native Physical AI segments—autonomy, humanoid robotics, foundation/world-model builders, simulation-first startups, defense and dual-use—converting them into flagship customer wins that validate our platform, establish category credibility in-region, and create reference gravity for the rest of EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsegment Theses &amp;amp; Category Building (EMEA Lens):&lt;/strong&gt; Define EMEA-specific subsegment theses and extract cross-account insights to establish repeatable deal patterns. Identify which European customer profiles convert fastest, which use cases generate the highest consumption, which objections appear most frequently (sovereignty, AI Act compliance, data residency, EU-based support), and which regional GTM motions actually work. Operationalize those learnings into scalable sales plays the EMEA field can run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA Sales Playbook Development:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Codify market learnings into a comprehensive “EMEA Physical AI Playbook.” Develop battle cards, positioning guides, objection-handling frameworks, and competitive intelligence materials specific to the EMEA buyer. Deliver formalized, documented sales motions that the broader EMEA field team—across the UK, DACH, France, Benelux, Nordics, Southern Europe, the Middle East, and Israel—can execute independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Field Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a force multiplier for the EMEA sales organization. Run internal enablement sessions and training for EMEA Sales, SAs, and Marketing on Physical AI positioning, target personas, regional regulatory framing (EU AI Act, GDPR, sovereignty), and use-case framing. Publish case studies and reference stories from EMEA lighthouse wins to arm the broader regional team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Conversion in Region:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the long-term revenue trajectory of the Physical AI domain in EMEA, ensuring that early lighthouse technical wins translate into high-volume compute consumption as customers scale their training, simulation, and inference workloads on Nebius infrastructure—and that EMEA contributes its full share of the Physical AI revenue target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MEA Market Intelligence &amp;amp; Competitive Positioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a real-time understanding of the EMEA Physical AI competitive landscape. Track where other cloud providers are winning or losing within our target segments. Feed competitive intelligence into sales assets and deal strategy. Position Nebius&#39;s European-headquartered, sovereignty-friendly posture as a structural advantage where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Ecosystem Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Evangelize our capabilities at EMEA-relevant industry events (e.g., Hannover Messe, Automatica, European Robotics Forum, VivaTech, AI Summit London, Web Summit, Slush, and EMEA editions of ICRA/IROS/CoRL when applicable) and customer executive briefings—positioning Nebius as the infrastructure of choice for Physical AI workloads built and deployed in Europe and across the broader EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7+ years &lt;/strong&gt;of experience in sales overlay, GTM strategy, or domain-specialist selling within Cloud, AI Infrastructure, or High-Performance Computing—with a meaningful portion of that experience focused on EMEA customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA Operating Fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep familiarity with how to sell across the UK, DACH, France, Benelux, Nordics, Southern Europe, the Middle East, and Israel. You understand that EMEA is not one market and you have a point of view on which subregions to lead with for a category like Physical AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Pipeline Generation: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated track record of personally sourcing and generating qualified pipeline across EMEA through outbound prospecting, industry relationships, and strategic account engagement at the executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Acceleration DNA: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience partnering with Account Executives across multiple EMEA countries to accelerate complex enterprise and startup deals. You know how to frame a use case, position value, and act as an executive sponsor to drive closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Playbook Builder: &lt;/strong&gt;You have built GTM motions from scratch before—segmenting a market, defining the pitch, creating the sales plays, and training a broader regional team to execute. Bonus if you have done it specifically for EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Domain Fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;You speak the language of the builders. You understand the difference between model training, simulation, synthetic data generation, and inference workloads. You know the key players—startups and incumbents—across the modern Physical AI stack, with strong recall of the European cohort specifically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory &amp;amp; Sovereignty Awareness: &lt;/strong&gt;Working knowledge of the EU AI Act, GDPR, data-residency expectations, and the sovereign-cloud conversation in Europe. You can speak credibly with customers for whom these are first-order procurement considerations rather than afterthoughts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You enjoy teaching and scaling knowledge. You can take complex technical wins and distill them into simple, repeatable sales motions for a broader EMEA team that lacks your domain depth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Orchestration: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven track record of working across Sales, SAs, Marketing, and Product Marketing—often across multiple EMEA countries and time zones—to align distinct teams behind a unified GTM execution plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Startup &amp;amp; AI-Native Fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience working with (or selling to) high-growth, venture-backed European startups. You understand the urgency, the technical depth, and the rapid decision-making of this customer base, as well as how European founders and CTOs evaluate infrastructure differently from their US counterparts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong executive presence and communication skills, capable of holding your own with VC-backed founders, CTOs, and senior technical decision-makers across EMEA. Additional European languages (German, French) are a plus, not a requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort in Ambiguity: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience operating in fast-moving environments where the sales motion is not yet fully defined and requires real-time iteration and pattern recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Why Nebius:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;You are not inheriting a quota on an existing product line in an existing region; you are building the EMEA revenue engine for an entirely new category of cloud infrastructure, in our strategic home market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Definition: &lt;/strong&gt;Define the EMEA playbook that the rest of the company will use to sell Physical AI in the region for years to come.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontier Technology: &lt;/strong&gt;Work at the bleeding edge of embodied intelligence, engaging with the companies defining the future of robotics, autonomy, and the physical world—right at the center of Europe&#39;s accelerating AI buildout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structural Advantage: &lt;/strong&gt;Nebius is European-headquartered. Sovereignty, EU data residency, and regulatory alignment are real selling points—not retrofits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Leverage: &lt;/strong&gt;Focus on the top 10% of transformative EMEA customers that drive the next 90% of growth within this segment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission: &lt;/strong&gt;Help define how intelligence moves from the data center into the physical world—starting from Europe. &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-GH1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, what’s the role all about?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Customer Success Manager is required to ensure Cognigy’s customers feel they are supported and guided through their journey with implementing Cognigy’s products and to ensure their expected outcomes are delivered with further expansion also achieved. The role serves the Director Customer Success to maintain a balanced portfolio across the CS team, and the wider company is served to streamline communication externally.​&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your extensive experience with enterprise software solutions to guide customers in strategically utilizing Cognigy&#39;s technology, thereby enhancing the value of their investment through innovative AI use cases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertly identify customer needs through structured discovery processes and ensure the timely coordination and implementation of solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide authoritative assessments and advice on our solutions, engaging in detailed technical discussions to elucidate the impact and value of technical features.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A master in the art of high-level dialogue as you engage directly with enterprise executives, articulating the strategic business value of our solutions and influencing top-tier decision-makers to drive transformational change within their organizations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track customer success metrics, using data to inform strategies and report on the value delivered to the customer and the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement effective customer retention strategies, including regular executive business reviews and customized engagement plans to minimize churn.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft compelling sales proposals for products and services, strategically aligning them with customer goals and negotiating terms that benefit both the customer and our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encourage and facilitate the development of customer advocates through case studies, testimonials, and referrals, contributing to the company&#39;s market reputation and growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in close synergy with sales and technical teams to drive customer loyalty and satisfaction, ensuring a cohesive approach to long-term customer success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have you got what it takes? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience in the software industry as a Customer Success Manager, with a proven track record of driving measurable business outcomes for customers, such as increased retention rates and product adoption.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CCaaS, AI or conversational AI a MUST. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of what constitutes strategic business value in the software industry, including familiarity with industry benchmarks and the ability to guide customers in setting and achieving ROI-driven objectives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, both written and oral, with the ability to articulate complex solutions clearly to customers. Must be adept at building rapport and fostering collaborative relationships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathetic to customer needs with the ability to employ a user-centric approach to ensure seamless customer experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical and structured approach to problem-solving, with experience using CRM platforms, Customer Success tools and data analysis software to prioritize and track value-driving activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness to travel up to 20% of the time within he USA&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A robust understanding of business and IT processes, particularly SaaS models, with a keen eye for identifying opportunities for process optimization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal alignment with our company’s values and culture, contributing positively to our work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated individual with a genuine interest in AI technology who is passionate about seeing AI used to generate business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join an ever-growing, market disrupting, global company where the teams – comprised of the best of the best – work in a fast-paced, collaborative, and creative environment! As the market leader, every day at NICE is a chance to learn and grow, and there are endless internal career opportunities across multiple roles, disciplines, domains, and locations. If you are passionate, innovative, and excited to constantly raise the bar, you may just be our next NICEr!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Cognigy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NiCE Cognigy delivers AI that works—fast, human, and enterprise-ready. As the leading AI-first CX platform built for real-world scale, we combine Generative and Conversational AI through orchestration, tools, and enterprise systems to power Agentic AI. Backed by global CX leader NiCE, we empower brands with AI Agents that redefine customer experiences and achieve measurable ROI—instantly, across every channel and in 100+ languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Requisition ID:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; 10670&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Reporting into:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Team Lead Customer Success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Type:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Individual Contributor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About NiCE &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NICE Ltd. (NASDAQ: NICE) software products are used by 25,000+ global businesses, including 85 of the Fortune 100 corporations, to deliver extraordinary customer experiences, fight financial crime and ensure public safety. Every day, NiCE software manages more than 120 million customer interactions and monitors 3+ billion financial transactions. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Known as an innovation powerhouse that excels in AI, cloud and digital, NiCE is consistently recognized as the market leader in its domains, with over 8,500 employees across 30+ countries. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NiCE is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, marital status, ancestry, neurotype, physical or mental disability, veteran status, gender identity, sexual orientation or any other category protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Account Executive – New Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote within Austria, Germany, Spain, Italy, Sweden or Poland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Full professional English and Portuguese&lt;/strong&gt;. Any other European language spoken in our markets (e.g. Spanish, German, Italian, French, Polish) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 5 years in B2B sales with a clear focus on outbound&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €40,000 – €50,000 gross/year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Join fiskaly! Finance that looks forward, not just backward.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At fiskaly, innovation drives us. We&#39;re reshaping the landscape of fiscal compliance with our cloud-based solutions for electronic receipts and invoices. Our team thrives on diversity and collaboration, committed to creating a supportive environment where everyone&#39;s contributions are valued. Join us to play a key role in our mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼 &lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive – New Business to build a pipeline and close business in new markets. This is an outbound-first role: you will open doors that are not yet open, through cold calling, email, video, LinkedIn and whatever creative prospecting gets you in front of the right person. You own the opportunity from first touch to signature, and you stay close to your customers after the deal is done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be selling into POS providers, billing and invoicing software vendors, ERP partners and retail technology companies — technical buyers who care about API quality and business buyers who care about staying on the right side of the law. Both conversations are yours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️ &lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through consistent, high-quality outbound activity: cold calls, sequenced email, video, LinkedIn and creative prospecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the full funnel: prospecting, discovery, solution mapping, negotiation, contract signing and post-sale support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the funnel moving: open new opportunities while advancing the deals already in play, with the discipline to do both every week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become genuinely credible on the fiscalization and e-invoicing regulations in your markets, so you can answer legal and basic technical questions without needing to escalate every time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate a technical API product into clear business value for non-technical buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Legal and Solution Engineering on the questions that genuinely need them, and bring the market&#39;s objections back into the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep your pipeline data clean and your forecast honest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;👀 &lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years in B2B sales with a strong outbound track record — you have built pipeline from nothing, not just worked inbound leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full professional English and Portuguese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any other European language spoken in one of our markets is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible presence: you can hold a room with a CFO, a product lead and a developer in it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A very good listener — you ask the second and third question, not just the first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodical and self-directed, with the discipline to keep activity consistent when nobody is checking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to explain complex, regulated topics simply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset: you enjoy an environment where the playbook is still being written and you are expected to help write it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, competitive and coachable, and honest about what you don&#39;t know yet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It will really impress us if you already have experience in the VAT world — e-invoicing, fiscal reporting or tax compliance software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International experience in a European startup or scaleup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in compliance, accounting, billing software, POS or PMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling an API-based or otherwise technical product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
