&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pgegcc&quot; data-start=&quot;2325&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of regulatory frameworks including PRA, DORA, and related operational resilience standards.&lt;/li&gt;
