&lt;p data-start=&quot;169&quot; data-end=&quot;232&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;169&quot; data-end=&quot;232&quot;&gt;Empower finance leadership through strategic transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;Capco is looking for Principal Consultants to join our growing Finance Transformation capability within the Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) practice. You&#39;ll play a key role in helping CFOs, Treasurers, and senior finance leaders maximise the value of their finance and treasury functions through operating model redesign, process transformation, and strategic technology delivery. You&#39;ll also leverage approved AI tools and AI-enabled ways of working to improve analysis, accelerate insight generation, and enhance delivery while applying responsible AI practices and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
