&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;63&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;63&quot;&gt;Trade &amp;amp; Transaction Reporting Director (Managing Principal)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;194&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;78&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London |&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;128&quot;&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;175&quot; data-end=&quot;184&quot;&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;196&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;196&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Shape the future of global regulatory reporting transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;264&quot; data-end=&quot;276&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;264&quot; data-end=&quot;276&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;1162&quot;&gt;Capco is seeking a Managing Principal (Director level) to lead our Trade &amp;amp; Transaction Reporting capability within the Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) practice. This role is ideal for someone who combines strategic vision with deep regulatory reporting expertise and a proven track record of leading complex, multi-jurisdictional transformation programmes. You&#39;ll partner with global financial institutions to deliver regulatory change, optimise reporting controls, and ensure sustained compliance across key reporting regimes including EMIR Refit, MiFIR, SFTR, CFTC, HKMA, and MAS. You&#39;ll also champion AI-enabled ways of working, helping clients and teams responsibly leverage approved AI tools, automation, and data-driven insights to improve reporting quality, operational efficiency, and decision-making while maintaining strong governance and human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1164&quot; data-end=&quot;1182&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1164&quot; data-end=&quot;1182&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1184&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bn2tqb&quot; data-start=&quot;1184&quot; data-end=&quot;1433&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end trade and transaction reporting transformation programmes across multiple global regulatory regimes, identifying opportunities to leverage AI-enabled workflows and automation to improve reporting quality and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wf5i0o&quot; data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Advise clients on regulatory implementation, remediation, and control optimisation across EMIR Refit, MiFIR, SFTR, HKMA, MAS, CFTC, and other reporting frameworks, ensuring robust governance and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1is7zcm&quot; data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1864&quot;&gt;Design, assess, and enhance reporting architectures, data lineage, reconciliations, and data quality frameworks, using AI-enabled analytics where appropriate to strengthen reporting accuracy and transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nfakql&quot; data-start=&quot;1865&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;Guide the implementation of regulatory reporting platforms and RegTech solutions, ensuring responsible AI adoption, appropriate validation, and effective oversight of AI-assisted outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bps73q&quot; data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot;&gt;Lead strategic client relationships, proposition development, business growth, and thought leadership within Capco&#39;s Regulatory Reporting capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
