&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lcvx20&quot; data-start=&quot;2236&quot; data-end=&quot;2367&quot;&gt;Extensive experience leading trade and transaction reporting transformation programmes across multiple global regulatory regimes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;48tava&quot; data-start=&quot;2368&quot; data-end=&quot;2509&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of transaction reporting regulations, reporting controls, reconciliations, data governance, and regulatory operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t8ngz8&quot; data-start=&quot;2510&quot; data-end=&quot;2639&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of capital markets products including OTC derivatives, listed derivatives, equities, fixed income, and FX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;155zbg2&quot; data-start=&quot;2640&quot; data-end=&quot;2804&quot;&gt;Experience using reporting technology, automation, and AI-enabled solutions to improve reporting effectiveness, operational resilience, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lj13nc&quot; data-start=&quot;2805&quot; data-end=&quot;2969&quot;&gt;Proven ability to influence senior stakeholders, develop strategic client relationships, lead consulting teams, and deliver large-scale transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
