&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you feel this is the opportunity you don&#39;t want to miss, you can apply by sending your cover letter and resume through the application form as soon as possible.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note that to be considered for this position, you must be based in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;EMEA or Eastern US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; and hold a valid work permit for your location. We&#39;re excited to connect with applicants who meet these criteria and share our passion to do hard things, trust each other, and build what&#39;s next for the product, the planet, and the people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
