&lt;li&gt;Experience in advertising, creative agency, production, or digital content operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in&amp;nbsp;German or French language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem‑solving mindset with the ability to translate business challenges into operational and technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder‑management skills, with the confidence to lead conversations during pitches and onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail, strong analytical capability, and a proactive approach to identifying risks and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working cross‑functionally and remotely across multiple markets and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
